# =============================================================================
# observability/.dockerignore
#
# Dockerfile.grafana copies NOTHING: it derives from the official Grafana image
# and deletes the two bundled datasource plugins this stack never loads. The
# dashboard template, the Prometheus scrape config and the alert rules in this
# directory are MOUNTED by docker-compose.yml at run time, never baked into a
# layer, so no file here is a build input.
#
# `*` with no re-admission is therefore the complete and correct policy.
# =============================================================================
*
